<title>BELGIUM: EU suspends ordinary cane molasses import tariff.</title>
<headline>EU suspends ordinary cane molasses import tariff.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday set cane molasses import duties at 0.38 Ecus per 100 kg, down from the ordinary rate of 0.41 ecus, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The committee suspended the ordinary GATT (General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade) tariff and set a new suspension duty due to rising world prices,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The new tariff is based on a reference price of 7.83 ecus per 100 kg, up from 7.57 ecus last week.</p>
<p>Beet duties remained suspended at zero based on a reference price of 12.08 ecus compared with 11.79 ecus last week.</p>
</text>
